      "content": "it feels like i'm just a ghost lately. like the person everyone actually knew, the one who actually mattered, is just... gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person staring back. it's like the real me died a long time ago and i'm just some hollow shell pretending to exist. turnin off the lights feels more honest than trying to keep this",
